From 0a83bd30779f0cfb48d5685867662577bbca197c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:34:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash command dispatch to keep backend
 commands out of prompts

Route slash-prefixed selected-agent input through provider backend command methods so commands such as /status and /fork resume the existing session as commands instead of being wrapped as ordinary chat prompts.
