+When a selected-agent message trims to `/` followed by a non-whitespace command token,
+`CommandChat` routes it to `AgentBackend::execute_slash_command_streaming` instead of
+`AgentBackend::send_streaming`. Those commands are not title prompts, do not mark the session as
+waiting for a normal reply, and bypass the selected-agent busy guard so provider commands such as
+`/status` can run while the session is otherwise busy.
